]>
<suzuki><manual>
<section sectnbr = "10J">
<servcat sctnbr = "10" scnbr = "10">
<configtype typenbr = "1">
<servinfotype sitcode = "6">
<servinfo servinfosgmlid = "AENLSB0AAA16009" svcinfotypenbr = "08" svcinfoqualnbr = "03" supplyoff = "1" modify = "0">
<title>
Inspection of Laser Radar
</title>
<attention1>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
When ignition is “ON”, 1M class laser beam in IEC60825-1 standards is irradiated from the dual sensor brake support control module. This laser beam is not harmful to eyes in normal usage. However, without observing the following precautions, an optical impairment or loss of eyesight in worst case may occur.
</ptxt>
</item>
<list2 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Using a magnifier etc., do not look into dual sensor brake support control module from a distance within 100 mm (3.94 in.).
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
To avoid danger of harmful irradiation, never disassemble dual sensor brake support control module.
</ptxt>
<table frame = "all" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1" page = "1">
<tgroup cols = "2" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<colspec colnum = "1" colname = "1" colwidth = "2.748in"/>
<colspec colnum = "2" colname = "2" colwidth = "0.708in"/>
<thead>
<row rowsep = "1">
<entry namest = "1" nameend = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1">
<ptxt>
Laser specifications
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row rowsep = "1">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1">
<ptxt>
Maximum average output
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" align = "center">
<ptxt>
45 mW
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep = "1">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1">
<ptxt>
Pulse width
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" align = "center">
<ptxt>
33 ns
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep = "1">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1">
<ptxt>
Wavelength
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" align = "center">
<ptxt>
905 nm
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep = "0">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1">
<ptxt>
Angle of divergence (horizontal x vertical)
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" align = "center">
<ptxt>
28&#176; x 12&#176;
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</item>
</list2>
</list1>
</attention1>
<attention3>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
When replacing dual sensor brake support control module, use new control module. If used one is installed, DTC (C1681) could be detected due to mismatch of each registration.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
When replacing windshield or dual sensor brake support control module, it is necessary to perform 
<intxref refid = "AENLSB0AAA16002">Dual Sensor Brake Support Control Module Aiming Adjustment:Dual Sensor Brake Support</intxref>
.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Perform inspection of dual sensor brake support control module indoors avoiding exposure to direct sunlight.
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</attention3>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Arrange a vehicle (1) in front of the inspected vehicle (2).
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGSB0AAA2053.swf" width = "183.000mm" height = "52.967mm" ver = "01" gw = "426" gh = "134"/>
<callout>
<table frame = "all" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<tgroup cols = "4" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<colspec colnum = "1" colname = "1" colwidth = "0.315in"/>
<colspec colnum = "2" colname = "2" colwidth = "1.968in"/>
<colspec colnum = "3" colname = "3" colwidth = "0.315in"/>
<colspec colnum = "4" colname = "4" colwidth = "1.968in"/>
<tbody>
<row rowsep = "0">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
“a”:
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
1,571 mm (61.85 in.)
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "3" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
“b”:
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "4" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
1,429 mm (56.26 in.)
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</callout>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Connect SUZUKI scan tool to DLC (1) with ignition “OFF”.
</ptxt>
<servicetool>
<servicetoolitem id = "L10J105">
<s-part>
(A)
</s-part>
<s-number num = "NNNNN-00035">
SUZUKI scan tool (Suzuki SDT-II)
</s-number>
</servicetoolitem>
</servicetool>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGSB0AAA2047.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "87.737mm" ver = "01" gw = "205" gh = "232"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Set ignition “ON”.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Select “Lidar Center Beam Distance” under “Data List” of SUZUKI scan tool.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Check that “Lidar Center Beam Distance” is in normal condition. If not, replace dual sensor brake support control module. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0AAA16001"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
<table frame = "all" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<tgroup cols = "3" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<colspec colnum = "1" colname = "1" colwidth = "2.169in"/>
<colspec colnum = "2" colname = "2" colwidth = "2.867in"/>
<colspec colnum = "3" colname = "3" colwidth = "2.169in"/>
<thead>
<row rowsep = "1">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1">
